    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know they aren't facts but it feels so real though. like, i see the way they sigh when i walk into a room. or how they look exhausted just trying to deal with my moods. it feels like im just a parasite living off their energy. it would be so much more selfless to just let them breathe without me holding them back.",
